<page xmlns="http://projectmallard.org/1.0/" type="topic" id="index" xml:lang="en">
  <title>Help and Support Center</title>
  <p>Press Windows key + F1 to open this help center from any application.</p>
  <section id="desktop">
    <title>Desktop and files</title>
    <p>Open My Documents from Start. To find a file elsewhere, choose Start → Search.</p>
  </section>
  <section id="network">
    <title>Network connections</title>
    <p>Choose Start → Connect To. Select the wireless network and open Properties to inspect its addresses.</p>
  </section>
  <section id="printers">
    <title>Printers and printing</title>
    <p>Open Printers and Faxes from Start, then choose Add a printer. After setup, open the printer properties to print a test page.</p>
  </section>
  <section id="input">
    <title>Keyboard and mouse</title>
    <p>Open Control Panel in Classic View and choose Keyboard or Mouse. Use the test area before applying your settings.</p>
  </section>
  <section id="programs">
    <title>Programs and packages</title>
    <p>Open Add or Remove Programs in Control Panel. Press Ctrl+F, type a program name, and press Enter to select the first match. To install a local .deb, choose Install from file, select the package, then check its name, version and architecture. Choose Open installer to continue.</p>
  </section>
  <section id="fonts">
    <title>Fonts and input methods</title>
    <p>Open Fonts in Control Panel. Press Alt+I to preview the font used for input method candidates, then Alt+P to open its sample sheet. Choose Print to print the sheet.</p>
  </section>
  <section id="more">
    <title>More help</title>
    <p>
      <link href="help-list:">Browse all installed help</link>
    </p>
  </section>
</page>